WEBVTT

00:06.440 --> 00:09.430
The mistress must be vacationing
at the beach right now.

00:09.430 --> 00:13.240
Lucky her. I wish we could
go to the beach, too.

00:14.320 --> 00:15.710
Don't!

00:15.710 --> 00:16.940
There!

00:23.200 --> 00:27.520
Evil insects released like breath.

00:28.390 --> 00:31.670
They fill the land and punish the people,

00:32.130 --> 00:35.930
their appearance like the surging waves.

02:03.740 --> 02:07.410
I'll Have My Revenge!

02:07.730 --> 02:09.600
It looks just like the
place I saw in my dream.

02:09.970 --> 02:11.020
What?

02:49.540 --> 02:51.440
What is that?

03:04.100 --> 03:05.600
Our...

03:06.250 --> 03:08.950
Our barbecue...

03:09.320 --> 03:11.470
I can't believe it would do this...

03:20.120 --> 03:21.430
Unforgivable!

03:22.440 --> 03:25.260
You're unusually excited about this.

03:25.260 --> 03:27.680
Could it be? Could it really be?

03:31.380 --> 03:32.690
Jörmungand!

03:33.220 --> 03:35.060
Take this!

03:37.380 --> 03:41.570
There! There! There!

03:42.210 --> 03:43.610
What is this thing?!

03:43.610 --> 03:46.160
I can't believe my axe
didn't put a dent in him!

03:48.330 --> 03:49.790
Move out of the way! Be careful!

03:54.620 --> 03:56.040
Hey!

03:56.450 --> 03:58.330
What are you aiming at?

04:07.770 --> 04:11.230
You'll pay for ruining our barbecue!

04:12.000 --> 04:15.100
We'll get you back by
turning you into barbecue!

04:19.760 --> 04:22.490
It's not working at all.

04:22.490 --> 04:24.340
What is this thing?

04:24.340 --> 04:25.710
It's a Lucasite.

04:26.760 --> 04:28.120
A Lucasite?

04:28.700 --> 04:30.370
It's the thing that came
out of the meteorites...

04:30.370 --> 04:33.760
...and is spreading all the Toripu everywhere.

04:33.760 --> 04:37.130
It's trying to destroy Aquafall.

04:37.980 --> 04:41.170
Then those strange insects
we've been seeing recently...

04:52.510 --> 04:53.930
Look, Toripu.

04:55.530 --> 04:57.240
There are so many!

04:57.240 --> 04:59.700
At this rate, they'll destroy us.

04:59.700 --> 05:00.690
Leviatan?

06:45.490 --> 06:46.970
This is it!

06:46.970 --> 06:51.090
This is the Aquafall Defense
I've been looking for!

06:52.070 --> 06:54.350
The Aquafall Defense, huh?

06:56.060 --> 06:59.070
In any case, it looks like they're
going to give it their best shot.

06:59.470 --> 07:00.900
I guess I'll see what they can do.

07:01.550 --> 07:02.720
Come on, everyone!

07:02.720 --> 07:05.650
Let's combine our powers to protect Aquafall!

07:05.900 --> 07:07.650
We will...

07:07.650 --> 07:09.900
...avenge...

07:10.500 --> 07:11.910
...our barbecue!

07:11.910 --> 07:13.170
Oh...

07:13.650 --> 07:14.910
You're upset about that?

07:31.050 --> 07:32.490
Go!

07:36.440 --> 07:37.750
Nice work!

07:55.330 --> 07:56.740
Amazing!

08:09.440 --> 08:11.340
That's it!

08:11.340 --> 08:12.970
Get them, get them!

08:12.970 --> 08:14.590
More, more!

08:16.140 --> 08:18.100
Not bad.

08:23.860 --> 08:26.610
But you're almost at your limit.

08:35.320 --> 08:37.010
Is that all of them?

08:37.010 --> 08:38.120
All that remains is...

08:50.710 --> 08:52.830
This is for the barbecue!

08:52.830 --> 08:54.470
Take this!

09:00.830 --> 09:03.270
I think that might have worked.

09:03.270 --> 09:06.070
Jörmungand, hit it again.

09:06.070 --> 09:09.690
I wish I could, but I don't think I can.

09:09.690 --> 09:11.290
What?

09:11.290 --> 09:13.940
I'm at my limit.

09:12.650 --> 09:13.940
What?!

09:13.940 --> 09:16.120
You're so lazy!

09:16.120 --> 09:19.990
I'll show you the power of
the dragon, ruler of fire!

09:20.870 --> 09:23.280
I will avenge my vacation!

09:37.890 --> 09:39.140
Are you okay?

10:02.050 --> 10:05.620
Water, lend me your strength.

10:16.120 --> 10:17.260
Leviatan!

10:25.500 --> 10:26.310
Watch out!

10:29.820 --> 10:31.480
Levi.

10:34.990 --> 10:36.160
Onii-chan.

11:07.540 --> 11:08.230
My spear!

11:34.760 --> 11:38.000
Leviatan. Leviatan!

11:41.890 --> 11:43.050
Oh, good.

11:50.990 --> 11:52.350
My spear.

11:57.550 --> 11:58.940
Where is my spear?

12:01.540 --> 12:03.020
No...

12:10.630 --> 12:13.000
A monster came out of the sea?

12:15.440 --> 12:19.130
Miss, we won't fall for that again.

12:20.460 --> 12:22.180
I'm not lying.

12:22.180 --> 12:24.300
A huge monster really did come out of...

12:26.300 --> 12:29.690
I thought you had grown into a young lady,

12:29.690 --> 12:32.200
but there you go again, lying like a child.

12:32.200 --> 12:34.310
I told you, it's not...

12:34.310 --> 12:35.560
It's a Lucasite!

12:35.560 --> 12:37.420
A Lucasite appeared!

12:37.420 --> 12:39.070
This world is in danger!

12:39.820 --> 12:43.820
Come, now. Why don't you take a bath first?

12:43.820 --> 12:47.830
We'll prepare dinner in the meantime.

12:53.610 --> 12:55.540
How rude!

12:56.020 --> 12:58.780
Both of them are treating me like a child.

12:58.780 --> 13:01.170
Well, as long as you've
got bruises on your butt,

13:01.170 --> 13:03.650
you can't help being treated like a child.

13:03.650 --> 13:04.930
I don't have any.

13:04.930 --> 13:07.310
Would you like to see some proof?

13:11.270 --> 13:15.060
Listen, I understand
you're depressed, but...

13:15.620 --> 13:17.600
That spear must have been important.

13:17.600 --> 13:19.940
What's just one spear?

13:19.940 --> 13:22.730
I can ask my father to make
you an even better—

13:22.730 --> 13:24.320
It has to be that one.

13:26.140 --> 13:27.600
It has to be that spear.

13:28.360 --> 13:31.040
I need it.

13:40.630 --> 13:42.840
Thanks for waiting.

13:44.880 --> 13:46.590
This looks delicious!

13:48.130 --> 13:49.850
Thanks for the food!

13:50.130 --> 13:53.300
There's plenty of food,
so help yourself to seconds.

13:58.510 --> 14:03.860
The food's good, but I'm not
happy with this location.

14:08.670 --> 14:10.620
This pasta's super delicious.

14:10.620 --> 14:13.640
This spear squid is
especially delicious.

14:15.430 --> 14:16.710
My spear...

14:17.600 --> 14:18.960
Thanks for the food.

14:18.960 --> 14:21.430
You're finished already?

14:21.890 --> 14:23.060
I'm sorry.

14:36.020 --> 14:40.330
I'm really not happy with
this special treatment...

14:53.170 --> 14:55.810
My spear...

14:57.920 --> 14:59.160
If...

14:59.580 --> 15:03.670
If I had used my magic better, then...

15:13.760 --> 15:16.060
Leviatan was really depressed.

15:16.870 --> 15:20.010
Her precious spear was
taken away from her.

15:21.280 --> 15:25.590
When Yurlungur swallowed my axe...

15:46.230 --> 15:48.210
Answer me, ocean.

15:49.380 --> 15:51.830
Show me where my spear is.

16:02.150 --> 16:03.940
It doesn't seem to have worked.

16:04.270 --> 16:09.190
I know that spear's important to
you, but you should give it up.

16:09.570 --> 16:13.520
It's probably somewhere far away by
now, still stuck in that monster...

16:17.140 --> 16:19.090
Then I'll go look for it.

16:19.580 --> 16:21.090
What are you talking about?

16:21.090 --> 16:22.790
I'll go with you.

16:23.280 --> 16:25.040
Go with her? Why?

16:25.040 --> 16:27.540
To thank her for getting my axe back.

16:27.540 --> 16:28.860
What?

16:31.860 --> 16:33.330
In that case, I'm going, too.

16:34.910 --> 16:36.010
Because...

16:37.050 --> 16:39.100
Because we're friends, right?

16:45.270 --> 16:47.610
Okay, let's go!

16:48.020 --> 16:50.410
Sure, but where?

16:50.410 --> 16:53.210
The direction that monster
headed, of course.

16:53.210 --> 16:54.050
Yeah.

16:55.060 --> 16:56.970
Which way is that?

16:56.970 --> 16:57.620
The ocean.

17:00.270 --> 17:04.110
If you head directly west
from here, there's a desert.

17:04.850 --> 17:06.080
You...

17:06.710 --> 17:07.800
Who are you?

17:07.800 --> 17:09.340
What's with this kid?

17:09.700 --> 17:13.090
You'll find the Lucasite
if you go to that desert.

17:14.400 --> 17:17.640
Okay, let's head for the desert, then.

17:17.640 --> 17:19.170
Hold on.

17:19.170 --> 17:22.400
You're going to listen to a kid
we don't know anything about?

17:22.400 --> 17:25.000
But we don't have any other leads.

17:25.000 --> 17:27.630
Yeah, but...

17:31.760 --> 17:33.320
He disappeared...

17:42.240 --> 17:47.550
The girls still haven't gotten up yet.

17:47.550 --> 17:49.840
They must have tired
themselves out playing.

17:49.840 --> 17:52.860
Let them sleep a little longer.

17:58.530 --> 18:01.100
What are we doing so early in the morning?

18:01.520 --> 18:06.350
Is the Aquafall Defense pursuing the Lucasite?

18:06.350 --> 18:09.460
Hey, who are you calling
the Aquafall Defense?

18:09.460 --> 18:12.870
Now, now. Mu-chan, it's too
early to be getting so angry.

18:12.870 --> 18:14.860
What? Mu-chan?

18:15.270 --> 18:17.360
Are you talking about me?

18:17.360 --> 18:20.330
Yeah. Your name's Bahamut,
so you're Mu-chan.

18:20.330 --> 18:21.710
What is that?

18:21.710 --> 18:24.370
I'll never let you call me that.

18:24.370 --> 18:27.950
What? I think it's cute, though.

18:27.950 --> 18:29.880
Levi-tan, you agree, right?

18:29.880 --> 18:31.740
Levi...tan?

18:32.300 --> 18:34.660
Levi-tan and Mu-chan, huh?

18:34.660 --> 18:36.380
Yeah? Look who's talking, Syrorin.

18:36.380 --> 18:37.870
Now you've said it!

18:37.870 --> 18:39.180
I'm not Syrorin!

18:39.180 --> 18:42.480
My name's the superbly cute Syrop!

18:44.200 --> 18:45.390
Now, then.

18:45.390 --> 18:50.340
It seems they're moving
exactly according to plan...

20:11.660 --> 20:19.500
Next Episode

20:14.580 --> 20:19.500
I'll Find it!
